   "locked": false,
   "text": "States: empty — no rows for the filter: \"No rows for this filter. To add a value where no base row exists, use 'Add cell'\" plus an \"Add cell\" button that opens key\npickers; loading — skeleton grid and panel skeleton; error — edit not applied: value restored, with an error icon and the engine message; engine error banner with\nRetry; base moved — warning banner with Rebase; success — edit applied and consequence shown.",
   "originalText": "States: empty — no rows for the filter: \"No rows for this filter. To add a value where no base row exists, use 'Add cell'\" plus an \"Add cell\" button that opens key\npickers; loading — skeleton grid and panel skeleton; error — edit not applied: value restored, with an error icon and the engine message; engine error banner with\nRetry; base moved — warning banner with Rebase; success — edit applied and consequence shown.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 1,
